[3:21:47 PM] [semantic-release] [@semantic-release/commit-analyzer] › ℹ  Analyzing commit: feat(rates): on-chain DEX quoter for token prices (BE-205)

Adds a DexQuoterModule that produces indicative token prices by quoting
against configured on-chain DEX routers. Supports Uniswap V2-style
getAmountsOut and Uniswap V3 QuoterV2.quoteExactInputSingle (probes
every configured fee tier and returns the best amountOut).

- DEX_QUOTERS config per network in config/common.ts; Citrea is wired
  to JuiceSwap V3 against wcBTC (router 0x565e…3cF8, quoter 0x428f…8425,
  fee tiers 100/500/3000/10000).
- IDexQuoterConfig type added in src/types/config.ts.
- New ABIs: UniswapV2Router.getAmountsOut, UniswapV3QuoterV2.quoteExactInputSingle.
- Module is a standalone building block — wiring into proxyToken/rates
  for priceUsd is a follow-up. getRateInNative returns the price in
  wrapped-native units; callers multiply by the wrapper's USD price
  (e.g. BTC for Citrea) to derive priceUsd.
- Unit tests cover V2/V3 happy paths, fee-tier iteration, fallback
  across multiple DEXs, and all failure modes. Integration spec added
  for real-network smoke checks.
