User-supplied startDateProp/endDateProp were written directly onto the
filter object in createFilter. Sending '__proto__' as either prop
mutated Object.prototype globally, which then crashed the GC histogram
observer (uncaughtException) and broke joi schema cloning across the
process.

Reject __proto__/prototype/constructor at the model layer and tighten
the joi schema to reject them upstream.

* fix(api): reject non-string date prop values in createFilter
