[3:21:47 PM] [semantic-release] [@semantic-release/commit-analyzer] › ℹ  Analyzing commit: feat(api): add token totalSupply cache with 30-minute freshness

Add on-read staleness check for token totalSupply via a new lightweight
RabbitMQ queue (token.totalSupply) in aragon-gateway. When the API serves
token data and totalSupply was last fetched >30 min ago, it triggers a
refresh through the gateway which has RPC access.

- New totalSupplyUpdatedAt field on Token model
- New tokenTotalSupply queue handler in gateway (Web3Helper.getTokenTotalSupply)
