Bump mongoose from ^8.21.1 to ^9.2.3 and @typegoose/typegoose from
^12.20.0 to ^13.2.0. Add default value to static create() method
in all 35 model schema files to satisfy mongoose 9's new zero-argument
overload on Model.create().

* chore(BE-161): adapt codebase for mongoose 9 breaking changes and optimizations

Migrate deprecated APIs (new→returnDocument, allowDiskUse), add .lean() to read-only queries,
use exists() for existence checks, optimize bulk deletes, hoist toObject() outside loops,
fix dao update() tautology condition, and remove dead memberAddress index.

* fix(BE-161): add default params to create() for mongoose 9 compatibility

campaignMerkleRoot and logDelegateChanged create() signatures need default
params to match mongoose 9 Model.create() which allows 0-arg calls.

* fix(BE-161): fix test stubs missed during merge with development

Update gaugeHandler test to stub findExistingLog instead of exists,
and capitalDistributor test to expect returnDocument instead of new.

* test(BE-161): add test for zero deletedCount branch in _removeStaleAssets

* test(BE-161): cover uncovered branches from mongoose 9 changes

Add test for pluginToUpdate null guard in pluginSetupProcessorHandler
and zero deletedCount branch in daoAssets._removeStaleAssets.

* test(BE-161): add tests to meet 90% branch coverage threshold

